  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "类似地，把关于不等式两边分别相加的定理应用于不等式",
        "$x<2.6$ 与 $y<1.5$，得：",
        "$x+y<4.1$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "这样，我们就求出了两个数 $x$ 与 $y$ 之和的界：",
        "$3.9<x+y<4.1$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "注意，把这个问题的解法写成二重不等式是很方便的：",
        "$\\begin{array}{c}2.5<x<2.6\\\\↵ 1.4<y<1.5\\\\\\hline↵ 3.9<x+y<4.1.\\end{array}$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "根据关于不等式两边分别相加的定理，同样可以求出两",
        "个数 $x$ 与 $y$ 之差的不足近似值和过剩近似值。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "因为 $x-y=x+(-y)$，所以为了求出差 $x-y$ 的界，先要",
        "估计式 $-y$ 的大小，然后再应用不等式两边分别相加的定理估",
        "计和 $x+(-y)$ 的大小。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "已知，$1.4<y<1.5$。这就意味着，$-1.4>-y>-1.5$。",
        "用 $<$ 号把后一个关系写出来：",
        "$-1.5<-y<-1.4$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "把关于不等式两边分别相加的定理应用于二重不等式",
        "$2.5<x<2.6$ 与 $-1.5<-y<-1.4$，",
        "得：",
        "$\\begin{array}{c}2.5<x<2.6\\\\↵ -1.5<-y<-1.4\\\\\\hline↵ 2.5+(-1.5)<x+(-y)<2.6+(-1.4).\\end{array}$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "因此，",
        "$1<x-y<1.2$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
